  "title": "Mushroom Sauce with Red Wine",
  "description": "This rich mushroom sauce recipe is made with a bold, dry red wine, beef broth, mushrooms, and thyme. It is lovely with grilled steaks or filet mignon.",
  "authors": [
    "TonyD"
  ],
